  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1526114111143789}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 1238
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 看这情况，若是再拖延些时间，让天魔的实力完全恢复，对宁州必是一场浩劫。眼下有葛前辈通知其他门派，不如我们先行阻挠一番，等候支援。
